{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026yC2YWIxPDX1792737053.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產天水圍副區域營業董事伍耀祖表示，天水圍新晉屋苑YOHO West備受市場追捧，本月錄得16宗二手買賣成交，較上月12宗增加33%，平均實用呎價約13774元。<br/>伍耀祖表示，YOHO West二期YOHO West Parkside 2B座高層B6室，實用面積408平方呎，兩房間隔，向東北，叫價600萬元，經議價後以560萬元成交，實用呎價13725元。原業主於2025年3月以473.92萬元一手買入單位，持貨約19個月，賬面獲利86.08萬元，升幅18.2%。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T07:22:27.864940+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":236,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T06:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T08:18:10.214388+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:18:12.170048+00:00","content_hash":"9b3b54f7b2f8b7c16770e027c0886f68fc8813fe7e4851f61ad856e3d528bd9d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T07:22:27.864940+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}